    "detailed_description": "Welcome aboard <strong>SEX Airlines</strong> \ud83d\udd1e\u2708\ufe0f - an adult visual novel where you shape the story of professional pilot Arthur and people around him! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/23852f855a9c2ad93153a7deafe6a53c.poster.avif?t=1747064432\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/23852f855a9c2ad93153a7deafe6a53c.webm?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/23852f855a9c2ad93153a7deafe6a53c.mp4?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your first flight at the Patricia Airport is getting cancelled due to serious paperwork issues a cutie named Jenny has. Jenny is in trouble, and on your way home you discover she encounters unfairly harsh treatment from the police officer who\u2019s watching her, so you decide to take turns. You\u2019ll get to know her dark past later if you dare and insist\u2026 <br><br>She\u2019s not the only intriguing girl around though! Meet:<br>\u2014 Ayaka - get to know if your fiery relationship is just a spark.<br>\u2014 Maya - would you become her mentor and partner or would your paths go in different directions?<br>\u2014 Jada - build your new career with her help and guidance and see if it leads to something bigger.<br>\u2014 And many others, of course!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/5b869ea1afc0eee44bfa9d6fb024a9a1.poster.avif?t=1747064432\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/5b869ea1afc0eee44bfa9d6fb024a9a1.webm?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/5b869ea1afc0eee44bfa9d6fb024a9a1.mp4?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u200bThe game features varying storylines based on your decisions - your actions have an impact. The story is tied around the intertwining results of both random encounters and your choices - these aspects shift the events in unpredictable ways. Would you succeed in helping Jenny escape and discover the truth, or would you lose her? Would you end up living happily ever after with flight attendant Ayaka or is it just a glimpse? And what about Maya and Jada? The story holds many secrets yet to be discovered!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Non-linear story</strong> - your choices shift the outcome of events, impacting the life of everyone around you.<br></li><li><strong>Many endings</strong> - from friendship to passion to anger, from success to disappointment and frustration - discover them all!<br></li><li><strong>Animated 18+ scenes</strong> - enjoy realistic, meticulous 3D graphics in adult lewd scenes designed to deepen the character relationships.<br></li><li><strong>Profound and insightful characters</strong> - discover their unique personalities and stories as you shape your relationships with them.<br></li><li><strong>Fascinating graphics </strong>- 3D models with beautiful rendering and high-quality animations help the immersion and enhance story-telling!<br><br>Every decision you make matters. Are you ready to take on the challenge and determine your own course, pilot?</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome aboard <strong>SEX Airlines</strong> \ud83d\udd1e\u2708\ufe0f - an adult visual novel where you shape the story of professional pilot Arthur and people around him! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/23852f855a9c2ad93153a7deafe6a53c.poster.avif?t=1747064432\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/23852f855a9c2ad93153a7deafe6a53c.webm?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/23852f855a9c2ad93153a7deafe6a53c.mp4?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your first flight at the Patricia Airport is getting cancelled due to serious paperwork issues a cutie named Jenny has. Jenny is in trouble, and on your way home you discover she encounters unfairly harsh treatment from the police officer who\u2019s watching her, so you decide to take turns. You\u2019ll get to know her dark past later if you dare and insist\u2026 <br><br>She\u2019s not the only intriguing girl around though! Meet:<br>\u2014 Ayaka - get to know if your fiery relationship is just a spark.<br>\u2014 Maya - would you become her mentor and partner or would your paths go in different directions?<br>\u2014 Jada - build your new career with her help and guidance and see if it leads to something bigger.<br>\u2014 And many others, of course!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/5b869ea1afc0eee44bfa9d6fb024a9a1.poster.avif?t=1747064432\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/5b869ea1afc0eee44bfa9d6fb024a9a1.webm?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014600/extras/5b869ea1afc0eee44bfa9d6fb024a9a1.mp4?t=1747064432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u200bThe game features varying storylines based on your decisions - your actions have an impact. The story is tied around the intertwining results of both random encounters and your choices - these aspects shift the events in unpredictable ways. Would you succeed in helping Jenny escape and discover the truth, or would you lose her? Would you end up living happily ever after with flight attendant Ayaka or is it just a glimpse? And what about Maya and Jada? The story holds many secrets yet to be discovered!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Non-linear story</strong> - your choices shift the outcome of events, impacting the life of everyone around you.<br></li><li><strong>Many endings</strong> - from friendship to passion to anger, from success to disappointment and frustration - discover them all!<br></li><li><strong>Animated 18+ scenes</strong> - enjoy realistic, meticulous 3D graphics in adult lewd scenes designed to deepen the character relationships.<br></li><li><strong>Profound and insightful characters</strong> - discover their unique personalities and stories as you shape your relationships with them.<br></li><li><strong>Fascinating graphics </strong>- 3D models with beautiful rendering and high-quality animations help the immersion and enhance story-telling!<br><br>Every decision you make matters. Are you ready to take on the challenge and determine your own course, pilot?</li></ul>",
